---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<div class="row flex-lg-row-reverse py-5">
  <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold text-body-emphasis lh-1 mb-3">
    Code <span class="highlight">changes</span> the world.
  </h1>
  <p class="lead">
    如同 wordpress 所说的，“<i>Code is poetry.</i>
    ”（代码如诗），因此享受每次编程中的代码，也何不常是一种趣事呢。
  </p>
  <p class="lead">故有：</p>
  <h4 class="mb-3">
    AI can write my code, but it{" "}
    <b style="text-transform: uppercase;">
      <mark>cannot</mark>
    </b>{" "}
    enjoy writing it for me.
  </h4>
  <div class="d-grid gap-2 d-md-flex justify-content-md-start">
    <a
      href="https://mcenahle.dev/gh/"
      target="_blank"
      type="button"
      class="btn btn-primary btn-lg px-4 me-md-2"
    >
      查看我的 GitHub 主页 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" />
    </a>{" "}
    <a
      href="/contributions/"
      type="button"
      class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg px-4"
    >
      我在开源项目上的贡献
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
